{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY THE DEMO NOW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>ISLAND GETAWAY</i></strong><i> is a first-person horror adventure game from the creator of <strong>The Last Monday</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've won a free weekend vacation to a luxurious island resort, but arrive to find yourself trapped by the powerful forces of nature, the supernatural, and the corporate sector.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention and act fast if you want to get back to the mainland alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Presented in Ultra-wide vision, creating an immersive cinematic experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Haunting atmosphere and soundscape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful retro-inspired visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling gameplay that throws you into the deep end</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No powers or weapons. Just a suitcase</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709230?t=1752793288","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709230/5d5240306bd98ca76a7cdc8b49cebd33cab62d9f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752793288","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709230/bb26932b44ca06f60d46e4fdefc01ea4cd72f84c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752793288","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709230/bb26932b44ca06f60d46e4fdefc01ea4cd72f84c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752793288","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains strong horror themes as well as depictions of violence"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY THE DEMO NOW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><stro